      m_Calls: []
  m_text: '[MAYDAY! MAYDAY!]


    You''re a spaceman on your way home to Earth after
    humanity''s first ever journey through a wormhole - a monumental event in history!


    Although
    in a tragic miscalculation- you find yourself having crash landed in a foreign
    planet! You could''ve sworn you were enroute home.. but it seems like the wormhole''s
    messed up the navigation systems.


    Now you''re stranded in the ruins of
    a foreign planet with a busted ship - and you need to get home. Scavenge for
    materials and clues to get home, mankind needs you!




    Press the C key to
    start.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: dc36b3fdc14f47ebb36fd484a67e268a, type: 2}
